
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="Contact QuickTools Hub with questions, suggestions, or feedback.">
  <title>Contact Us | QuickTools Hub</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f5f7fb;
      color: #20283b;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    header {
      background: #263aee;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 28px 16px;
    }
    nav {
      background: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 16px;
    }
    nav a {
      color: #263aee;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin: 0 10px;
    }
    main {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 32px auto;
      padding: 28px;
      background: white;
      border-radius: 14px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(20, 35, 70, .07);
    }
    h2 { color: #263aee; }
    .contact-box {
      background: #eef1ff;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 18px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .contact-link {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #263aee;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 11px 18px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 24px;
      color: #657087;
    }
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      main { margin: 18px; padding: 20px; }
      nav a { display: inline-block; margin: 6px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>Contact Us</h1>
    <p>We welcome your questions and feedback.</p>
  </header>

  <nav>
    <a href="index.html">Home</a>
    <a href="about.html">About</a>
    <a href="privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a>
    <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
  </nav>

  <main>
    <h2>Get in Touch</h2>
    <p>Have a question about one of our calculators, found an issue, or have an idea for a new tool? We'd be happy to hear your feedback.</p>

    <div class="contact-box">
      <h2>Email Us</h2>
      <p>Send your questions and suggestions by email.</p>
      <p><strong>Important:</strong> Replace the example email address below with an email address you control before publishing this page.</p>
      <a class="contact-link" href="mailto:YOUR-EMAIL@example.com?subject=QuickTools%20Hub%20Feedback">Send an Email</a>
    </div>

    <h2>What Can You Contact Us About?</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Reporting calculation errors or technical issues</li>
      <li>Suggesting new calculators and converters</li>
      <li>Sharing feedback about the website</li>
      <li>Asking questions about our privacy policy</li>
    </ul>

    <p>We appreciate your patience. Response times may vary.</p>
    <p><a href="index.html">Return to QuickTools Hub</a></p>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>© <span id="year"></span> QuickTools Hub.</p>
  </footer>
  <script>
    document.getElementById("year").textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
